msgid "Add a page"
msgstr "Hinzufügen einer Seite"

msgid "Add feature"
msgstr "Feature hinzufügen"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Allow line return in Title & Subtitles"
msgstr "Zeilenumbruch in Titeln & Untertiteln erlauben"

